The third transfer of 15,000 RWF surprised me because the starting balance of 32,000 RWF looked large enough at first glance to cover two 15,000 RWF transfers 
with money to spare, leaving 1,500 RWF after deducting the two 250 RWF fees. Because 1,500 RWF was less than the 15,250 RWF required for the third 
transfer (amount plus fee), the third transfer failed with Failed: insufficient balance, yet the remaining 1,500 RWF was still enough to buy 1,000 RWF of
 airtime (which has no fee) and leave a final balance of 500 RWF.
